          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ህራንም፡ ይጮሃሉ፡ ከዚህ፡ (በታች ፡ አይለ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወጥም)፡ (አስተትክሙ፡ ወተደለውክሙ)፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢትፍጽም ፡ አፉሁ ፡ ለላሕም ፡ ሶበ ፡ ታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከይድ ፡ እክለከ ፡ ይደልዎ ፡ ዐስቡ፡ ለዘይት",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቀነይ ፡ ያለውን ፡ ሥርዐት ፡ አፈረሳችሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(ወቀተልክምዎ) ፡ መምህሩን ፡ የዕለት፡ ራ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቱን ፡ ነሥታችሁ ፡ በረሃብ ፡ ገደላችሁት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(ዘእንበለ ፡ ይትቃወምክሙ) ፡ ዳኛ ፡ አው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጥቼ ፡ ዘንግ ፡ አቅንቼ ፡ ወርቅ ፡ በሚዛን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልካፈል ፡ ሳይላችሁ ፡ (ወእሆ) ፡ ያልተመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
